      "text": "Information Session\n\nOnline SIR form Jharkhand\n\nTraining by: Research Team Imarat Shariah Bihar\nOdisha Jharkhand and WB\n1\n\n\fVoter registration Muhim\n\nRegistration se pehle ye cheezen tayyar rakhen\n\n1. Mobile Number linked to Adhar and voter ID\n2. Passport Size Photo\n3. Parents 2002/3/5 voter details (assembly No, Booth\n\n(part) No, and serial number)\n4. Adhar Number\n5. Father and Mother Name\n\n2\n\n\fStep 1: sign-up aur login\nGoogle pe ‘voter\nservice’ search karen\nhttps://voters.eci.gov.in/\nper click karen\n\nGreen colour me “Fill Enumeration\nForm” par click karen\n\nMobile aur captcha fill\nkaren phir continue par\nclick karen\n‘Sign Up’ par click karen\n\n\fStep 1: sign-up aur login\nOTP type karen\n\nFirst name aur last name\nfill karen, Phir request ITP\npar click karen\n\nLogin per click\nkaren\n\nMobile/Epic no fill karen\nCaptcha fill karke request\nOTP par click karen\n\nOTP type karen\n\n\fStep 2: State select karke Voter ID and Mobile number enter Karna\nSelect State pe\nclick kijie\n\nJharkhand pe\nclick kijiye\n\nApna Epic number\nenter kijie\n\nApne vote ID ki puri\nApna Mobile number\ndetails aapko jazar\nenter karke send OTP\nAyegi\npar click kijiye\n\n\fStep 3: Category select karke parents ki details upload karna\nAgar abbu ammi dada dadi ya\nnana nani me se kisi ka bhi naam\nkisi bhi state me 2003 2002 ya\n2005 ke voter list me tha to 2nd\noption ko choose kijiye\n\nAgar abbu ammi dada dadi\nya nana nani me se kisi ka\nbhi naam kisi bhi state me\n2025 ya 2026 ke voter list\nme tha to 3rd option ko\nchoose kijiye\n\nAgar 2nd option pe click\n\nAgar kisi ka naam Kiya h to phir parents ka\nnahi h to last option voter ID jis state me the us\npar click kijiye\nstate ko select kijie\n\n\fStep 3: Category select karke parents ki details aur photo upload karna\n\nPhir booth number aur\nserial number daal kar\nselect relationship par\nclick kijiye\n\nIn 4 me se 1 option\nchoose kijiye aur\nsearch par click\nkijiye\n\nSearch par click karte hi\nparent ki puri details aap\ndekh payenge, ab tick ke\nnishaan par click karke\ncontinue pe click kijie\n\nIs me se sir wahi box fill\nkarna h jis par red star\nlaga hua h yaani father\nand mother name baaki\nsab ko nahi bharna h\n\nChoose file par click\nkarke apna passport size\nphoto upload karna h\n\n\fStep 4: Aadhar Card ke through E-Hastakshar karna\nPhoto upload kake\nsubmit par click kijie\n\nAb apna aadhar card daal\nkar OTP daalie aur tick\nkijiye\n\nSubmit par click\nkijie\n\nAb aapka form submit ho chuka h,\nscreenshot lijie aur BLO ko send karke bolie\nki verify kardijiye jaise hi wo verify kardega\naap ke paas edit ka option band ojayega\n\n\fJazakallahu Khaira\nFor help please whatsapp: 7070552322 (mufti Qeyamuddin Qasmi)\n09990457104 (Dr Consultant)\nResearch Team Imarat Shariah Bihar, Odisha, Jharkhand and WB\n\n\f"
    }
